      "id": "c:4030028919",
      "kind": "correctness",
      "harm": "Adding a completion file after configuration will not trigger reconfiguration or installation without manual cmake rerun, leading to flakiness",
      "quote": "if(EXISTS ${...}): The problem is that adding a file may change the behavior of install, but only after cmake was manually rerun. Adding the file will not trigger the reconfiguration by itself.",
